    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d462">

                <pb facs="0506" n="472" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg472"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Barrett to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-02-02"><hi rendition="#italic">February 2,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Siam agrees Cheek arbitration in acceptable form, except hold arbitration shall
                    include administration of estate, which is new issue. Shall I accept and close
                    matter?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Barrett.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
